  "args": {
    "report": "I have added an API reference to README.md, covering all the functions and classes in the tariffs package, including examples and error messages. I have also added a worked example for the rate card in data/rates.json and an example to README.md that loads the rate card and shows its zones and what they charge."
  }
}
```
